              "name": "body",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "<h2>Automated Lead Analysis</h2>\n<br />\nThe Lead Agent has analyzed the current Lead data. Below you can find a summary of the operations performed. For more information go to the lead notes, it will include a list of suggestions.\n<b>Lead Id we've got: </b>  {{$context.$variables.leadId}} {{$context.$nodes.GETLEADDATA.$output.Name}} \n<br />\n<h3>Automated Actions taken:</h3>\n<b>Assigned:</b> {{$context.$variables.assigned}}<br />\n<b>Scored:</b>  {{$context.$variables.scored}}<br />\n<b>Ranked:</b> {{$context.$variables.ranked}}<br />\n<b>Converted:</b> {{$context.$variables.converted}}<br />\n<br />\n<div style=\"text-align: right;\">\n<small><i>This is an automatically generated message. Do not reply</i></small>\n</div>\n"
            },
