              "id": "1764180944905_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "using {{$context.$nodes.REFRESHCACHEDLEADINFO.$output}} please create a bulleted list of suggestions. \nAdd to the context the actions taken as in\n<h3>Automated Actions taken:</h3>\n<b>Assigned:</b> {{$context.$variables.assigned}}<br />\n<b>Scored:</b>  {{$context.$variables.scored}}<br />\n<b>Ranked:</b> {{$context.$variables.ranked}}<br />\n<b>Converted:</b> {{$context.$variables.converted}}<br />\n<br />\n## Information\nPlease note if the contacts are validated already or if we need to get certain information currently not found on the lead.\nAdd specific actions that must be taken by the sales representative on this lead towards moving it forward on the sales cycle.\nInclude any information for achieving a cross-sell, upsell that you may deem necessary and sell strategy.\nThe suggestions may have HTML formatting.\nDo not embellish the text of the recommendations be concise \n##requirement \nUse less than 8000 characters for your recommendations\n\n##requirement\nreturn the suggestions into the string AILeadSuggestions"
